OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 28 MAY
OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GThis recital of Schubert lieder
OL,6,     Gis part of Montreal's Bourgie
OL,7,     GHall concert series of his
OL,8,     Gcomplete songs leading up to the
OL,9,     G200th anniversary of his death in
OL,10,     G1828.
OL,11,G0630FBreakfast
OL,12,     GAl Ryan presents Radio 3's
OL,13,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,14,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,15,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,16,     GIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,17,     Gclassical music for your morning,
OL,18,     Gwith discoveries and surprises
OL,19,     Grubbing shoulders with familiar
OL,20,     Gfavourites.
