OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 28 MAY
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GAs part of Wigmore Hall's 125th
OL,6,     GAnniversary Festival the early
OL,7,     Gmusic specialist Jordi Savall
OL,8,     Gpresents a concert of music by
OL,9,     GMonteverdi including the pastoral
OL,10,     Gballet 'Tirsi e Clori'.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Miles Davis
OL,12,     F100
OL,13,     GKate Molleson and American jazz
OL,14,     Gcritic Nate Chinen explore a
OL,15,     Gtumultuous and pivotal period in
OL,16,     Gthe story of Miles Davis.
OL,17,G1700FIn Tune
OL,18,     GKatie Derham welcomes viola
OL,19,     Gplayer Rosalind Ventris & pianist
OL,20,     GNigel Hutchison as they perform
OL,21,     Glive ahead of Rosalind's
OL,22,     Gappearance at the Elgar Festival.
